# Africa MCP — environment example.
# Copy to `.env` (git-ignored) and fill only what you need.
# Defaults run EVERYTHING on free mock providers with zero signup, zero network.

# ---- Provider selection (per lane) ----
FX_PROVIDER=mock           # mock | live  (live = central-bank scrapers/APIs + Quidax parallel)

# ---- Cache ----
# Last-known-good rate cache TTL, in seconds (default 300)
CACHE_TTL_SECONDS=300

# ---- Staleness ----
# Hours after which a daily-publishing bank's rate is flagged stale (default 48 = 2 business days)
FX_STALE_THRESHOLD_HOURS=48

# Live FX mode notes:
# - No API keys are required for any v1 live source (central-bank pages/APIs and the
#   Quidax public ticker are all keyless).
# - Live scrapers are polite: one fetch per publish cadence, custom Wycord User-Agent,
#   capped retries. Point a bank's config at a dead URL and the tool degrades to its
#   last-known-good value with stale: true rather than erroring.